Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ installs pycomm3 1.2.16
(https://github.com/ottowayi/pycomm3, MIT) from PyPI into a Docker
container on the tester's machine and runs a small client program of
ours (interop/peer/client.py, Apache-2.0) with it. No pycomm3 source is
included in this repository; the image is not distributed.

Test data
---------

Every tag name, value, serial number, address and product name in this
module is a made-up demo value.
